# Nothing but the two source projects reaches the build context.
#
# The exclusions below are not tidiness. A signing key, a ledger or an outbox
# that finds its way into a build context finds its way into an image layer,
# and an image layer is a thing that gets pushed to a registry.
**/bin
**/obj
**/*.private.json
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/licences-issued.jsonl
**/codes-outbox.jsonl
**/licences.db*
**/data
.git
